                // For snippet, nlohmann shows "<U+000A>" etc? Actually we saw snippet '"<U+000A>"'? Let's check earlier: for "{"a": "\n"}" error snippet '"<U+000A>"' ? Actually snippet was '"<U+000' truncated. Hard to replicate precisely.
